{
  "id": "06-free-fabric-resources",
  "title": "Three free Fabric learning resources",
  "duration": 38.9227,
  "beats": [
    {
      "text": "Three free Microsoft resources for learning Fabric. Save these official pages.",
      "asset": "dp700",
      "device": "tile",
      "start": 0.0,
      "end": 5.0453,
      "voice_end": 4.8853
    },
    {
      "text": "One. A Fabric trial gives eligible users sixty days to explore the platform.",
      "asset": "trial",
      "device": "focus",
      "key": "60 days",
      "start": 5.0453,
      "end": 10.1547,
      "voice_end": 9.9947
    },
    {
      "text": "Use it to practice lakehouses, ingestion and reporting. Check the current trial limits before you start.",
      "asset": "trial-home",
      "device": "sequence",
      "start": 10.1547,
      "end": 16.48,
      "voice_end": 16.32
    },
    {
      "text": "Two. The DP seven hundred practice assessment is available free on Microsoft Learn.",
      "asset": "assessment",
      "device": "focus",
      "key": "Practice assessment",
      "start": 16.48,
      "end": 21.952,
      "voice_end": 21.792
    },
    {
      "text": "Use the feedback to find gaps. It is a study tool, not a guarantee of an exam result.",
      "asset": "assessment",
      "device": "sequence",
      "start": 21.952,
      "end": 27.2533,
      "voice_end": 27.0933
    },
    {
      "text": "Three. The exam sandbox lets you explore the exam interface before booking your test.",
      "asset": "assessment",
      "device": "focus",
      "key": "Exam sandbox",
      "start": 27.2533,
      "end": 32.2987,
      "voice_end": 32.1387
    },
    {
      "text": "Start with the certification page and follow its official links. Keep the resources together for your next study session.",
      "asset": "dp700",
      "device": "focus",
      "start": 32.2987,
      "end": 38.9227,
      "voice_end": 38.7627
    }
  ],
